            <description><![CDATA[<h3>Sign-in</h3><ul><li>GitHub sign-in works again. 0.2.0 shipped with the ID of a retired OAuth app; Harbor now uses its new app, which needs no client secret.</li></ul><h3>CLI and polish</h3><ul><li>`harborcli local --root` with a folder that doesn&#x27;t exist is an error, not &quot;No repositories found&quot;.</li><li>Errors and help name the command `harborcli`.</li><li>The &quot;stats are being generated&quot; notice says Harbor, not a leftover name.</li></ul>
]]></description>
